# Packaged games (tools/package.ps1).
Builds/
# Written by the cooker on every package.
**/Build/Windows/FileOpenOrder/

# Third-party art packs from the owner's libraries (US-T109): their licences forbid redistributing them, so neither
# the source files nor the imported assets are committed. tools/import-*.ps1 rebuilds them; see docs/ThirdPartyArt.md.
# That covers every pack: StarSparrow (US-T109), USC, Ultimate Spaceships Creator (US-T142), SSC, Space Station
# Creator (US-T143), and any added later.
Cpp/SourceArt/ThirdParty/
Cpp/Content/ThirdParty/
Cpp/Content/ThirdParty/USC/
Cpp/Content/ThirdParty/SSC/

# .NET build output of the capture host and the vendored MindAttic.Capture (US-T72).
Capture/**/bin/
Capture/**/obj/
Vendor/**/bin/
Vendor/**/obj/

# US-T171: the Prose Universe Interchange files are rebuilt from Core and a seed (tools/universe-export.ps1, tools/prose-sync.ps1;
# docs/PROSE.md). The schema copy and the reviewed proposals under Data/Lore are committed; the outbox journal is not.
Data/Prose/*.json
!Data/Prose/universe.schema.json
Data/Lore/.outbox/
Data/Prose/*.import-batches/
